  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting TVET for a just and green transition 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the adoption of measures in TVET to shape a green transition in the employment sector through skills provision. The project is implemented through institutional capability strengthening and capacity building of TVET teachers and trainers to improve pedagogical process to transfer green skills and competency. The project contributes to the strengthened capabilities of TVET to have a positive impact on greening the employment sector and catering for the specific needs of skilled professionals and young people to prepare them for a just and green transition.</narrative>
  </description>
